# winapi-x86_64-pc-windows-gnu 0.4.0

Import libraries for the x86_64-pc-windows-gnu target. Please don't use this crate directly, depend on winapi instead.

- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/winapi-x86_64-pc-windows-gnu/0.4.0
- Repository: https://github.com/retep998/winapi-rs
- Documentation: https://docs.rs/winapi-x86_64-pc-windows-gnu/0.4.0
- License: MIT/Apache-2.0

The package as published on crates.io carries no README. incan.pub wrote this one when it adopted the package as the Loaf `crates-io/winapi-x86_64-pc-windows-gnu`.
